{"t":"TRGP","made":"2026-11-27 02:42","name":"Targa Resources Corp.","ko":null,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Midstream","employees":3570,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://www.targaresources.com","summary_en":"Targa Resources Corp., together with its subsidiaries, owns, operates, acquires, and develops a portfolio of complementary domestic infrastructure assets in North America. It operates in two segments, Gathering and Processing, and Logistics and Transportation. The company is involved in gathering, compressing, treating, processing, transporting, and selling natural gas; storing, fractionating, treating, transporting, and selling natural gas liquids (NGL) and NGL products, including services to liquefied petroleum gas exporters; and gathering, storing, terminaling, purchasing, and selling crude oil. It is involved in the purchase and resale of NGL products; and sale of propane, as well as provision of related logistics services to multi-state retailers, independent retailers, and other end-users. In addition, the company offers NGL balancing services; and transportation services to refineries and petrochemical companies in the Gulf Coast area, as well as purchases, markets, and resells natural gas. The company also leased and owned railcars, tractors, vacuum trucks and pressurized NGL barges. Targa Resources Corp. was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Targa Resources Corp.는 자회사와 함께 북미 지역의 보완적인 국내 인프라 자산 포트폴리오를 소유, 운영, 인수 및 개발합니다. 수집 및 가공, 물류 및 운송이라는 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 천연가스의 수집, 압축, 처리, 처리, 운송 및 판매에 참여합니다. 액화석유가스 수출업체에 대한 서비스를 포함하여 천연가스 액체(NGL) 및 NGL 제품을 저장, 분류, 처리, 운송 및 판매합니다. 원유 수집, 저장, 터미널 처리, 구매 및 판매. NGL 제품의 구매 및 재판매에 관여합니다. 프로판 판매 및 여러 주 소매업체, 독립 소매업체 및 기타 최종 사용자에게 관련 물류 서비스 제공. 또한 회사는 NGL 밸런싱 서비스를 제공합니다. 걸프 연안 지역의 정유소 및 석유화학 회사에 대한 운송 서비스는 물론 천연가스 구매, 판매 및 재판매도 담당합니다. 이 회사는 또한 철도 차량, 트랙터, 진공 트럭 및 가압 NGL 바지선을 임대하고 소유했습니다. Targa Resources Corp.는 2005년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":285.53,"mcap":61261606912.0,"pe":25.26814,"fpe":23.133362,"peg":null,"ps":3.3680766,"pb":16.050028,"ev_ebitda":13.927,"div":1.75,"beta":0.744,"hi52":316.6,"lo52":171.69},"fin":{"rev":18188900352.0,"rev_g":0.349,"eps_g":0.382,"gross":0.41818002,"op":0.22513,"net":0.13455,"roe":0.73421997,"fcf":162124992.0,"cash":142600000.0,"debt":19844499456.0,"de":501.048,"eps":11.3,"feps":12.34278},"own":{"short":0.0325,"inst":0.97530997,"insider":0.0138},"analyst":{"n":21,"mean":333.57144,"median":335.0,"high":362.0,"low":294.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.27273,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":16,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":15,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":15,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":14,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":362.0,"priorPriceTarget":359.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Scotiabank","ToGrade":"Sector Outperform","FromGrade":"Sector Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":325.0,"priorPriceTarget":319.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":330.0,"priorPriceTarget":324.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-07","Firm":"Jefferies","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":311.0,"priorPriceTarget":326.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":338.0,"priorPriceTarget":325.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"mai